# Keep Docs Current

When you make a change that affects any of the following, update the corresponding doc:

## .cursor/rules/project-context.mdc
Update when:
- A new composable, page, or server endpoint is added
- Architecture changes (new state pattern, new API integration, new module)
- A constraint is added or removed (e.g. cache strategy changes, a limitation is fixed)
- The current phase focus shifts

## PRODUCT.md
Update when:
- A roadmap item is completed (check the box)
- A product decision is made (add to decision log with date + rationale)
- Competitive landscape changes (new info about a competitor)

Do not update these docs for routine code changes (bug fixes, refactors, style tweaks).
